    <briefdescription>
<para>Stores parameters for searching animals within a terrain cell. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class encapsulates life stages, species, instars, and genders that are considered searchable. It allows filtering animals according to these attributes during simulations. </para>
